; One application, one meaning: reduce of an application built at run time
; answers as reduce of the same application written in place.  A name the
; engine provides or registers is applied at any arity: a call, a partial
; application, or the over-application error.
(= (two $x $y) (pair $x $y))
(= (two $x $y $z $w) (four $x $y $z $w))
